# Working memory

Agents update this file. It is the living snapshot of the project.

## Status

- **Status:** active
- **Updated:** 2026-09-20

## Project

- **Name:** Volleyball Manager (`volleyball-manager`)
- **Purpose:** Club platform for admins, coaches, players, and parents — seasons, rosters, live stats, volunteer, calendar, announcements, notes, dues.
- **Audience:** Youth/club volleyball (ADMIN, COACH, PLAYER, PARENT).
- **Stack:** Next.js 14 App Router + Tailwind (`apps/web-client`); NestJS (`apps/api-server`); PostgreSQL + Prisma (`packages/database`); Socket.io; npm workspaces; Docker Compose.
- **Package manager:** npm workspaces (Node 18+)
- **Deploy target:** Local Docker Compose first. Production host unset.

## Current focus

- Full local club stack is on `cursor/start-new-app-b09f` (PR #1), including ADMIN per-account theme colors (`/theme`, `PATCH /users/:id/theme`).
- Demo: sign in → `/home` hub → each module has a UI route. Admin vs coach accents differ (amber vs sky). Prove APIs with `npm run smoke`.
- Not in v1: Stripe, Redis, Storybook, public self-serve signup, multi-club.

